{"t":"SHW","n":"The Sherwin-Williams Company","nKo":"셔윈-윌리엄스 컴퍼니","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":349.47,"chg":9.73,"chgPct":0.02864,"prev":339.74,"dayH":349.74,"dayL":339.43,"w52H":377.77,"w52L":289.86,"vol":1967265,"avgVol":2112720,"mcap":84427784192,"pe":32.15,"fpe":26.53,"eps":10.87,"feps":13.17,"pb":21.11,"div":3.2,"divY":0.0092,"beta":1.05,"short":6085842,"shortPct":0.0252,"shortRatio":3.63,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Basic Materials","sKo":"기초재료","i":"Specialty Chemicals","iKo":"특수 화학물질","city":"Cleveland","emp":64249,"web":"https://www.sherwin-williams.com","sum":"The Sherwin-Williams Company engages in the development, manufacture, distribution, and sale of paint, coatings, and related products to professional, industrial, commercial and retail customers. The company operates through three segments: Paint Stores Group, Consumer Brands Group, and Performance Coatings Group. The Paint Stores Group segment offers architectural paint and coatings; protective and marine products; and OEM product finishes and related products for architectural and industrial paint contractors, and do-it-yourself homeowners under the Sherwin-Williams brand. The Consumer Brands Group segment supplies a portfolio of branded and private-label architectural paints, stains, varnishes, industrial products, wood finishes products, wood preservatives, applicators, corrosion inhib","sumKo":"Sherwin-Williams Company는 전문가, 산업, 상업 및 소매 고객을 대상으로 페인트, 코팅 및 관련 제품의 개발, 제조, 유통 및 판매에 종사하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 Paint Stores Group, Consumer Brands Group, Performance Coatings Group의 3개 부문으로 운영됩니다. Paint Stores Group 부문은 건축용 페인트 및 코팅을 제공합니다. 보호 및 해양 제품; 건축 및 산업용 페인트 도급업자와 Sherwin-Williams 브랜드의 DIY 주택 소유자를 위한 OEM 제품 마감재 및 관련 제품. 소비자 브랜드 그룹 부문은 브랜드 및 개인 상표 건축용 페인트, 스테인, 바니시, 산업용 제품, 목재 마감 제품, 목재 방부제, 어플리케이터, 부식 방지제 포트폴리오를 공급합니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":22148900000,"ni":2020100000},{"y":2023,"rev":23051900000,"ni":2388800000},{"y":2024,"rev":23098500000,"ni":2681400000},{"y":2025,"rev":23574